  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Subic-Clark-Manila-Batangas Railway, through Camdus Group, The</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds technical assistance (TA) related to the development of the Subic-Clark-Manila-Batangas (SCMB) Railway, a proposed 220-kilometer rail line connecting the major ports of Subic Bay, Manila, and Batangas in the Philippines. The TA would support the Philippine&apos;s Department of Transportation in conducting the project preparation work needed to prepare the SCMB Railway for financing in line with the requirements of the Asian Development Bank.</narrative>
  </description>
